OL,3,GNEWSAFour charged over attempted murder
OL,4,Aof man                                 
OL,6,FFour people have been charged in       
OL,7,Fconnection with the attempted murder of
OL,8,Fa man in Aberdeen.                     
OL,10,FThe 42-year-old was taken to hospital  
OL,11,Ffollowing an incident on Seaview Road  
OL,12,Fin the Bridge of Don area at about     
OL,13,F09:00 on Friday.                       
OL,15,FA 46-year-old woman and three men, aged
OL,16,F36, 48 and 50, have been charged over  
OL,17,Fthe incident.                          
OL,19,FThey are expected to appear at Aberdeen
OL,20,FSheriff Court on Monday.               
